title: The DVP has joined the Republic!
view-if: dvp_alignment >= 10 and violence_level >= 33 and dvp_in_government != 1 and spd_bd_position != "support_kpd" and dvp_alignment < 99
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
tags: event

= The DVP has broken it's neutrality!

With violence engulfing 33% of the country, the industrialists worry over their assets as already the RFB have begun to enact factory takeovers. Thankfully with their strong left wing they have convinced them to engage talks with us and after numerous talks, they have come to an agreement. In exchange for monetary support, we promise to provide protection against the RFB.

- @title: Nice

